<% content_for :title, "Insignia | Amenti Diez N°31" %>

<section class="page-shell mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-10 sm:py-14">
  <div class="page-intro max-w-3xl amenti-rise">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-amber-300/90">Marca institucional</p>
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-display mt-5 text-[2.65rem] leading-[1.04] text-ink sm:text-6xl">Insignia</h1>

    <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 sm:text-base">
      Esta es nuestra insignia maestra. La usamos en público con criterio y, cuando corresponde,
      con autorización explícita de la Logia.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <figure class="brand-figure amenti-panel amenti-panel-gold overflow-hidden rounded-[1.35rem] amenti-rise amenti-rise-delay-1">
      <div class="brand-figure-stage flex min-h-[22rem] items-center justify-center px-8 py-10">
        <% if amenti_master_logo_path %>
          <div class="hero-medallion relative flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="hero-medallion-plate absolute inset-0 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="hero-medallion-ring absolute inset-0 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="hero-medallion-glow absolute inset-0 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <%= image_tag amenti_hero_logo_dark_path || amenti_master_logo_path,
                          alt: "Insignia maestra de la R∴L∴S∴ Amenti Diez N°31",
                          class: "hero-logo-image relative z-10 max-h-[18rem] w-full max-w-sm object-contain sm:max-h-[20rem]",
                          decoding: "async",
                          data: {
                            logo_dark: amenti_hero_logo_dark_path || amenti_master_logo_path,
                            logo_light: amenti_hero_logo_light_path || amenti_master_light_path || amenti_master_logo_path
                          } %>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="brand-figure-caption px-6 py-5 sm:px-8 sm:py-6">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-300/90">Insignia maestra</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
          Reunimos triángulo, ave y cadena de unión. La presentamos con aire y fondo neutro
          para documentos, hero y comunicaciones institucionales.
        </p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure class="brand-figure amenti-panel overflow-hidden rounded-[1.35rem] amenti-rise amenti-rise-delay-2">
      <div class="brand-figure-stage flex min-h-[22rem] items-center justify-center px-8 py-10">
        <% if amenti_seal_path %>
          <div class="hero-medallion relative flex max-w-[15rem] items-center justify-center sm:max-w-[16rem]">
            <div class="hero-medallion-plate absolute inset-0 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="hero-medallion-ring absolute inset-0 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <%= image_tag amenti_seal_path,
                          alt: "Sello circular de Amenti Diez N°31",
                          class: "hero-logo-image hero-seal-image relative z-10 w-full object-contain p-3",
                          decoding: "async" %>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="brand-figure-caption px-6 py-5 sm:px-8 sm:py-6">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-300/90">Sello circular</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
          Versión compacta para navegación, pie de página, favicon y aplicaciones donde
          el espacio es reducido.
        </p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="guide-card amenti-panel rounded-2xl p-5 amenti-rise amenti-rise-delay-1">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-300/90">Nav / badge</p>
      <div class="brand-preview-well mt-5 flex h-24 items-center justify-center rounded-xl">
        <% if amenti_mark_path %>
          <span class="site-brand-mark h-16 w-16">
            <%= image_tag amenti_mark_path, alt: "Badge de navegación", class: "h-full w-full object-contain p-2", loading: "lazy" %>
          </span>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Cabecera sticky y accesos rápidos del sitio público.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="guide-card amenti-panel rounded-2xl p-5 amenti-rise amenti-rise-delay-2">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-300/90">Paleta</p>
      <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2">
        <% [["Night", "#070b12"], ["Blue", "#1e4d8c"], ["Gold", "#d4af37"], ["Ivory", "#f4f1ea"]].each do |label, color| %>
          <div>
            <span class="block h-12 rounded-xl ring-1 ring-white/10" style="background-color: <%= color %>;" title="<%= label %>"></span>
            <span class="mt-1.5 block text-center text-[10px] text-zinc-500"><%= label %></span>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Colores base para fondos, acentos y tipografía.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="guide-card amenti-panel rounded-2xl p-5 amenti-rise amenti-rise-delay-3">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-300/90">Criterio de uso</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
        <li>No alteramos proporciones ni recortamos símbolos fuera de contexto.</li>
        <li>Preferimos fondos neutros y aire alrededor del activo.</li>
        <li>La galería pública usa solo ambientación autorizada.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-note amenti-panel mt-8 rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      Aspiramos a variantes adicionales — monocromática, negativo y SVG vectorial — cuando estén disponibles
      y aprobados por la Logia.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
